WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.860
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.690
Phew, my neck is stiff now.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.860
closed captions

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.000
Why don't you take a break?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.200
Yeah, I'll do that.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:35.010
<i>Wow, so pretty. She's able to make those pretty crafts, yet she still has to practice more?</i>

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.240
Huh? What about your break?

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:39.970
Finished!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.460
I have to work harder.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.690
What are you looking at?

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.310
Monsieur Léon's homepage.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:49.190
Monsieur Léon?

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.910
He's a famous chocolatier in Paris.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:56.990
I've eaten Monsieur Léon's sweets once, and it was really delicious.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:59.620
I want to hurry up and go to Paris!

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.000
I want to get him to teach me, so I can sharpen my skills at making chocolate sweets.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:06.980
<i>When it comes to chocolate, I believe Kashino is skillful enough already</i>...

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.410
...<i>and he still wants to soar higher.</i>

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:13.630
Tell me the site too.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:17.030
Huh? But everything is written in French. You suck at it, don't you?

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:18.900
I might suck at French, but I'll do my best!

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:26.310
<i>Henri-sensei, everyone in this academy is working really hard.</i>

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.980
<i>In order to not lose, I'll work hard too!</i>

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:34.280
Ichigo-chan! The semifinals topic for the Cake Grand Prix has been placed on the notice board.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.270
Really?

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:43.290
Grand Prix
Semifinals

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:43.290
Chocolate Cake

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:43.290
