00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.570
The Grand Prix semifinals,

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.770
The topic is chocolate cake.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.290
The theme is...

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.490
..."Love".

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:47.910
Chocolate, that's Kashino's forte.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:51.040
Then we have a big advantage! Don't we, Kashino?

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.060
What's with that reluctant look on your face?

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:56.190
The chocolate cake is fine...

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.890
...but what's up with the theme "Love"?

