00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.790
I will tell you a-bout-it.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.170
Makoto-kun!

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:54.770
Makoto-kun! Makoto-kun! Makoto-kun!

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:54.770
You...

00:03:56.890 --> 00:04:00.370
Koshiro-senpai, every single time over and over, what the heck?

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:04.420
If I see you I cannot help myself but embrace you. This is love, <i>love I tell you</i>!

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:06.970
I can only think of this as harassment...

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:11.860
The theme "Love" is very fitting for Makoto-kun and I.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.770
This is fate, isn't it?

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.560
Yes, it's fate!

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.820
So with that, Makoto-kun.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:22.300
If we win in the semifinals, I'll have you join Team Koshiro.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.200
Huh? Why does it turn out like that?

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.300
Because it's for your own sake, of course.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.720
For your sake!

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:30.050
I refuse.

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:32.750
Huh? Are you afraid of losing?

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:38.780
To think that the one who is called the chocolate Sweets Prince is running away, you're quite a coward, aren't you?

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:40.920
If he has no confidence, then it can't be helped.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:44.140
I have confidence in winning.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.090
I won't lose to anyone when it comes to chocolate.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:49.130
If you're going to win, then why not promise us?

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:51.970
If you <i>do</i> lose, I'll have you join my team.

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:56.660
Fine.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:57.190
Kashino!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.680
Did all of you hear that, that, that!?

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.150
Yes! We heard it clearly!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:05.670
We even got it on the tape recorder.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:09.110
<i>If you </i>do<i> lose, I'll have you join my team.</i>

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:12.350
<i>Fine.</i>

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:13.700
Amano Ichigo!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.870
Makoto-kun is mine now.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.640
Hey! The match hasn't even begun yet!

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:24.420
Makoto-kun, let's meet each other in the Grand Prix.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:33.440
recipe 24

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:33.440
The Chocolate Cake of Love Challenge<i>!</i>

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:35.670
Love.

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:38.610
It's a heartrending, powerful, and sweet thing.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:42.090
There is no meaning in life without love.

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:45.110
Love is <i>the</i>  joy of living.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:49.450
By the way, a red rose is a sign of love.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.320
Here, I'll give this to you.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.870
Wow, thank you.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:56.430
How stupid.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:01.170
The "love" you say is so stupid is our theme this time around, though.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:05.290
We can just make the cake heart-shaped, isn't that fine?

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.720
Love isn't as simple as that.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.890
Do you think you can win with just that?

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:11.080
We can win.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:16.480
During the Valentine challenge, Ojou couldn't even beat Amano.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:18.320
She's no match for me.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:23.560
Putting Koshiro-san's actions aside, her feelings for you are truly love.

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:24.480
Like I care.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:29.150
If you disregard feelings of another like that, one day it'll end up biting you back.

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.280
You two, please stop.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.700
Calm down.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:37.530
Ordering top grade ingredients, that's all there is to Ojou.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:40.880
No matter how good her ingredients are, she doesn't have the skills to use them.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.770
I won't lose to her.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.790
Hey, Kashino! Where are you going?

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:46.690
We need to decide what cake we're going to make!

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:49.470
I have absolutely no clue about anything related to love.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.420
You three decide.

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.570
But..!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.710
As long as it's a chocolate cake, I don't care about the rest.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:57.140
When you've decided, tell me.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.600
Geez! He's so selfish.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:04.410
He's really no good with these things.

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:07.530
Ever since he was little, he's never had a good impression of girls.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:11.530
From when he was a kid, he was simply overly favoured.

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:15.700
Not only his classmates, their moms were all over him too.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:20.210
In elementary school, he got a mountain of love letters as if it were harassment.

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:22.920
He was always surrounded by the girls from his fan club.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:27.930
The girls on the streets stared at him and took pictures with their phones without even asking.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:30.890
There were a lot of persistent ones too.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:34.460
He was followed and chased everywhere. It was really hard on him.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:39.920
Some popularity he had. That was probably sort of unpleasant.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:44.580
Because he had that sort of trauma, he lost because of Koshiro-san last year, right?

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.930
After that, he started to hate girls even more.

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:51.190
I don't get it. What do they see in that narcissist?

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:54.530
That's the side I like the best about Ichigo-chan-

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.950
But there isn't much time left before the semifinals starts.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:01.660
For now, let's think up of an idea for a chocolate cake.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.590
Yeah.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.460
That's right...

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:14.370
Geez, they all don't get Kashino at all!

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:18.970
No matter what theme there is, there is nobody in this academy who can beat Kashino in chocolates.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:23.980
You don't have to care about what they say. Cause I really understand you, Kashin-

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.090
Shut up!

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:26.530
Huh?

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:27.980
Please be quiet.

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:32.530
That's not a tone to use! As your partner, Kashino, I-

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.240
I don't need you caring about me!

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.280
Don't mind me.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:40.040
What's with that?

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:43.550
I don't care what happens to you anymore!

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:49.270
Every one of them, what's wrong with them?

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:56.290
Even though it's only the single phrase topic of "chocolate cake", there are many types.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:57.990
What about a Sachertorte?

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:59.470
Sachertorte?

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:05.360
It's the sweet that is representing of Vienna, Austria and is called "The King of Chocolate Cakes."

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:08.220
The King of Chocolate Cakes, huh?

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:09.310
Isn't that good?

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:14.720
The Sachertorte requires a lot of effort to make and needs high-level skills. It's difficult to make.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:15.780
Oh, really?

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.200
Yeah.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:22.160
The main point in Sachertorte is in the chocolate coating covering the surface.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:26.220
It requires a really high skill of chocolate tempering.

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:30.710
That's my point exactly. This time the key point of the match is chocolate.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:35.840
By choosing the Sachertorte, I think we can draw out Kashino's skill with chocolates to the maximum.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.050
That means we're relying on Kashino.

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:44.560
Kashino is a really troublesome fellow, has a bad mouth, and gets mad easily, but he really works hard.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:49.110
He's practicing tempering everyday, and he studies a lot too.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.060
I'm jealous.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:51.540
Eh?

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.830
Don't worry, Ichigo-chan.

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:59.600
I'm not against the idea, and sometimes Kashino and I clash, but I trust in his skills.

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:00.280
Really?

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:04.520
We live in the same room after all.
If you watch him every day you can tell.

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:06.620
How hard he's really working.

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:12.620
The problem is how to make the Sachertorte fit in with the theme.

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:16.050
Chocolate sweets tend to look very monotonic.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:19.750
That's true, the Sachertorte's design is really simple.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.810
Decorations with the motif of love will be important.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.800
I'll think of something for the cake's design.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:27.890
Okay! I'll do my best!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.860
Ojou-sama, welcome home.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:37.780
I'm back.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:42.540
Ojou-sama, the limited edition bag by Royal Pacchin has been bought.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.710
Oh, is that so? Put it in my room.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:48.130
Ojou-sama, the dress that you had order-made has arrived.

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:49.870
It's more plain than I thought.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.500
I really don't need it.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.610
Understood. I will dispose of it then.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:58.650
<i>I'll show you that I can get everything I want.</i>

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:01.010
<i>The one that I want the most right now is...</i>

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:02.720
Makoto-kun!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:07.680
To obtain you, I'll use any means necessary.

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:14.150
As Ojou-sama has ordered, we've managed to order the carefully picked highest quality chocolate.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.370
Also, the person you asked for has just arrived from France.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.650
He's waiting in the hall.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:28.200
Darling! I'll soon make you a-l-l m-i-n-e.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.630
Go!

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.640
Here goes!

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:49.820
Looking good.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:53.490
Ah! It's heavy!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.400
Caramel!

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.090
Are you okay?

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:03.110
I can't seem to do this properly.

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:09.780
You can only practice. Satsuki and the others are working hard, so we have to put in effort and work hard too.

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:10.870
Right, Chocolat?

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.280
Chocolat, why are you eating it?

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:15.830
That's the cake we have to practice on!

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.240
What about it? Do you have a problem?

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:25.140
Geez, that Kashino. I didn't know he was that indifferent!

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.350
I don't care what happens to him anymore!

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.620
She's really pissed off huh...

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.060
She's eating it off.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.650
Okay.

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:40.530
Ah? You can think of a design here. I can sleep with the lights on.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:43.490
But I'm able to concentrate better if I'm alone.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.110
I'll think outside.

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:45.920
I see.

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:46.490
Sorry about that.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.960
Here, this will keep you warm so you won't catch a cold.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.380
Thank you. Good night, Rumi-san.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.380
Good night.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.230
Shall we go?

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:01.840
Yeah.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:09.850
That damn...

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.600
I figured that you'd be here.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.820
For the semifinals, we're going to make a Sachertorte cake.

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:22.440
Yeah.

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:26.070
Amano-san is going to design it.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:28.150
Yeah.

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:29.370
Kashino, you know...

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.240
Sorry, but I have to practice tempering.

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:35.750
Yeah. Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:42.460
Love. Affection.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:46.470
I can put it easily with a heart shape, but just that is a little...

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:49.630
Ichigo, have you ever been in love with a guy?

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.050
What I love are cakes.

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:54.050
Good food over good guys, eh?

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:56.240
Geez, you're such a girly girl.

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:58.930
What? So, what about you, Vanilla?

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:00.690
You don't have to go into my business.

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:05.590
Hmm... But regarding love, there are lots of different kinds.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.450
Lots, like?

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:15.640
There are heart-throbbing ones, or love at first sight ones. Those feelings are unique to each person, but that's not just love...

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:16.870
I know!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.710
You're getting on a roll!

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:24.770
It's done! Vanilla, look, look.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:29.520
Wow, it's cute! What are the things on the cake made out of?

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:30.140
These things are...

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:36.650
W-What was that just now?

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:39.390
It sounded like someone was knocking on the window...

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:41.320
Could it be a guest?

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:43.420
In the middle of the night...

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.810
Besides, isn't this the second floor?

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:49.870
It can't be... a ghost.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.310
T-That can't be it!

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:54.770
Anyway, we have to check it out.

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:55.920
Eeeh?

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.040
What's wrong? If it's a burglar, we're in trouble.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.490
Go on! Hurry, hurry.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:02.480
I-I get it, but you have to come with me, Vanilla.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:03.540
I know that.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.550
There's no one there.

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.380
Yeah. It seems it was my imagination.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:28.740
Phew. Oh, it's just Ayukawa-san.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:31.200
I thought you were a ghost. You startled me.

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:33.910
You know my name?

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:38.120
Of course! Ayukawa Yohko-san, we're classmates, aren't we?

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:41.330
During lessons, you're always trying hard, right?

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:45.420
I admire that. I thought I have much to learn from you.

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:49.160
What's wrong, coming this late at night?

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:51.380
Ah, could it be you're practicing making sweets?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.780
I do that a lot too.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:58.190
Won't you get cold dressed like that? It gets cold around nighttime, so you have to be careful not to catch a col-

00:15:58.190 --> 00:15:58.990
This.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.590
Is this the cake you're making for the Grand Prix?

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:07.940
Yeah, that's right. The base is Sachertorte. I figured I'll decorate it with lots of love.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.350
Lots of love?

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:10.940
Yeah.

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:14.470
I know there's a lot of different kinds of love.

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:18.830
The shapes and colours and sizes and weights of it all depend on the person, being different for everyone.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:23.760
With that in mind, we're going to add lots of different heart toppings to it.

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:29.080
This heart is fresh cream. This is berry. And this is orange peel.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:33.640
Sachertorte's flavour is rich, so when you eat it with various toppings,

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:36.230
you'll be excited to taste the many kinds of textures and flavours.

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:36.930
How...

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:37.790
Hmm?

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:40.800
How can you always be smiling?

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.910
Am I always smiling?

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:43.830
Yes.

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:50.440
I don't know myself, but I think it's because I'm thinking of making sweets with everyone is fun.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:53.820
It's not all fun and games becoming a pâtissière!

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:59.440
What's with that girl? She doesn't smile one bit.

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:01.330
I wonder what's wrong with Ayukawa-san?

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:04.950
I won't lose to that carefree girl.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.580
Sensei, how's this?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.200
Eeh? It's still not good?

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:33.150
Over, and over, and over, and over. How many times have I redone it? It's been 29 times already!

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:35.310
Ojou-sama, fight.

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:35.960
Fight!

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:37.030
I know!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.390
Ojou-sama, it's a text.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.330
I know that!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.810
Wow, this is...

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:43.450
Woah...

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.830
Show it to me already!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:45.920
Ojou-sama!

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.120
W-What?

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:50.040
It seems that Team Ichigo's cake has been decided!

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:55.380
Now I know what Amano Ichigo's plan is. The victory is mine.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:59.790
Definitely. Perfect. There's absolutely no doubt about it!

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:07.820
I know already! You don't have to tell me, I'll practice.

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:08.810
I'll do it. I'll do it-

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:11.340
Ojou-sama!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.880
Geez!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.580
Ready, set!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.790
Team Ichigo, do your best!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.590
Are Kashino and Hanabusa-kun still fighting?

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:41.690
Both of them are stubborn. But when
they're making sweets, they'll cooperate.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:46.750
In the end, we never practiced as a team at all.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.590
This never happened before. Will we be okay?

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.130
Team Koshiro is entering! Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.600
Can't they enter normally?

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:04.240
That is...

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.480
That's Monsieur Léon!

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:10.700
Eh? By Monsieur Léon you mean, the famous chocolatier from Paris?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:11.610
It's true.

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:12.920
What's he doing here?

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:18.260
Everyone, this is the famous chocolatier who came straight from Paris, Monsieur Léon.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:23.260
He said he wanted to see the Grand Prix, so we have decided to have him watch.

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.600
Léon!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.500
Eh?

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.310
Does Koshiro-san know him?

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:32.850
Know him? Oh please. He's been my teacher.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:38.490
During this past week or so, he's been tutoring me one-to-one everyday on tempering chocolate.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.500
From Monsieur Léon?

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:43.970
Moreover, one-to-one every day?

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:45.450
That's not fair!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:49.590
Oh? There's no rule saying that you
can't be taught by a professional.

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:52.000
I have the right to be taught by anyone.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:58.180
That guy hardly ever takes students, why...
How did you get him to teach you?

00:19:58.180 --> 00:20:03.110
This is the first time Makoto-kun is coming
over to me, that makes me happy.

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:09.220
Okay. If you want to know, I'll tell y-o-u.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.700
Satou, Shiotani.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:17.010
As you all are familiar with, these are
sweets sold by Château confectionery.

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:21.190
But Château confectionery doesn't just make and sell sweets.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:29.610
At Côte d'Ivoire, the world's greatest producer of cacao, the main ingredient of chocolate, Château confectionery has a cacao farm.

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:37.630
Château confectionery picks those cacao beans, processes them in a facility run by them, and creates the highest quality chocolate.

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:42.640
And we sponsor these to famous patisseries all over the world!

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:44.580
All over the world?

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:47.020
Is Château confectionery that great?

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:51.050
We sponsor the highest quality chocolates to Léon's store, too.

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:55.000
When I asked him to tutor me specially, he accepted without hesitation.

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.530
Right, Léon?

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:01.960
Makoto-kun, I've been doing my best for your sake.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:05.710
Look forward to the chocolate cake I make.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:16.420
I thought I couldn't lose at chocolate skills no matter what, but if Ojou mastered a professional's skills...

