St. Marie Academy's Cake Grand Prix.

00:23:05.380 --> 00:23:07.170
It's happening in real life too!

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:08.260
Let's take a look!

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:15.670
This is Japan's biggest western sweets contest hosted by Tokyo Western Confectionery.

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:19.500
2009 Japan Cake Show Tokyo.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:25.920
The hall is filled with pâtissières, or, like me, students aiming to be pâtissières.

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:29.450
All the girls who love sweets have gathered.

00:23:29.450 --> 00:23:32.090
With the sweets' scent and the heat, it's really getting intense in here!

00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:37.370
This is the work chosen for an award.

00:23:37.370 --> 00:23:40.020
Is this a sweet? Amazing!

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:43.610
And then, we found the Yume-Pati Booth!

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:48.720
I was shaking hands with everyone that attended and took some pictures as well.

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:52.810
I made lots of friends! I'm touched!

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:59.910
Although we've made it to the Cake Grand Prix semifinals, we have to work more!

00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:02.580
The Cake Grand Prix semifinals!

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:05.110
But Kashino and Hanabusa-kun are still fighting.

00:24:05.110 --> 00:24:07.970
Koshiro-san has been taught by a famous chocolatier so she's full of confidence.

00:24:07.970 --> 00:24:11.710
On top of that, our design has been stolen by the Team Koshiro!

00:24:11.710 --> 00:24:15.840
This time it's not my fault! The big and small Cake Pig-!

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:18.600
No good, I'm gonna lose...

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:20.500
Next episode, Goodbye, Kashino.

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:23.430
Do you want to eat Miya's love-love sweets?

